  "applies_to": "FlowCon SM.0.0.1.5 and SM.0.0.1.6 (fail-safe) actuators for FlowCon SM large pressure-independent control valves, BACnet MS/TP.",
  "summary": "Rotary actuators for FlowCon SM pressure-independent valves with BACnet MS/TP or Modbus. MV 6 picks the control source (voltage, mA, digital or serial bus); with serial control the BMS writes the demand to AV 4. The actuator reports position, flow, state, alarm flags and, on the SM.0.0.1.6, battery status for the power fail-safe.",
  "bacnet_transport": [
    "BACnet MS/TP"
  ],
  "firmware": "Actuator software FL1 V206, BACnet firmware V110",
  "default_device_instance": null,
  "access_inferred": false,
  "notes": [
    "Bitstring Value objects BSV 2 (alarm flags) and BSV 3 (user configuration flags) and Network Port 1 are listed as Other with their printed instance numbers.",
    "BSV 2 bits: 0 power fail, 1 no valve, 2 hardware, 3/4 overtorque CW/CCW, 5 over temperature, 7 no control signal, 8 battery fail, 9 power low, 10 was overtorqued, 12 network timeout.",
    "AI 4, AV 17 and MV 12 only apply to the SM.0.0.1.6 fail-safe version.",
    "Flow values (AV 16, AV 22) use the unit chosen in MV 5."
  ],
  "source": {
    "title": "BACnet PICS for FlowCon SM.0.0.1.5/SM.0.0.1.6",
    "doc_number": null,
    "revision_date": "2026-07-17",
